### CONFIRM or CANCEL Appointment
PUT http://localhost:8081/appointments/39613a7d-7978-4c4a-a7be-4a06a8456c9a"/status?action=confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

PUT http://localhost:8081/appointments/{{APPOINTMENT_ID}}/status?action=cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

